 "about_text": "AWASE gallery is a contemporary art gallery in Shinjuku, Tokyo, founded in 2025 by architect Riku Matsui and artist Kohei Yamada and based at the \"nudge field\" complex. Kohei Yamada curates the annual program, while Riku Matsui brings an architectural perspective, and the two develop exhibitions exploring the ambiguous theme of \"Landscape.\" The program highlights artists and architects whose work engages with space and structure, spanning abstract painting, sculpture, and installation, with an emphasis on emerging talent from Japan and elsewhere in Asia. The gallery also runs a companion project space, On, in the same building, used for curated shows, cross-disciplinary collaborations, and rentable presentations for outside organizations.",
